  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna TA &#xe4;r betyder att st&#xf6;dja utbudssidan ( Banker ) och             efterfr&#xe5;gesidan ( SMF ) i DCA ( gemensamt garantiavtalet mellan USAid &amp; Sida) f&#xf6;r Barclays och Standard Chartered . N&#xe4;r torer f&#xf6;r TA har    finlized en beg&#xe4;ran konkurrerande anbud kommer att g&#xf6;ras och en TA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This TA is mean to support the supply side (Banks) and the demand     side (SMEs) of the DCA (joint Guarantee Agreement between USAid &amp;     Sida) for Barclays and Standard Chartered. Once TORs for the TA have  been finlized a request competitive bids will be made and a TA        service provider contracted</narrative>
